OL,3,GNEWSABryant orders independent review
OL,4,Aof Parades Commission
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe demands came as a result of a
OL,7,Frecent court case that exposed flaws in
OL,8,Fsome of their procedures around a
OL,9,Fproposed Orange Order parade in
OL,10,FPortadown in July.
